{
  "illness": "depression",
  "unique_stat": "presence",
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "patient_says": "I don't really know why I'm here. Nothing feels worth doing anymore. Including this.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "You showed up anyway. That matters more than you might think.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What used to feel worth doing?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Well you're here so let's make the most of it.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "How long have you been feeling this way?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 1, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "patient_says": "I slept for fourteen hours yesterday. I wasn't even tired. I just couldn't get up.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That kind of sleep isn't rest. What was going through your mind when you finally woke up?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Does that happen often?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 1, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You should try to keep a regular sleep schedule.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "The body sometimes does that when carrying too much. What does a normal day look like for you right now?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "patient_says": "I used to love painting. I haven't touched my brushes in eight months.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Eight months is a long time. What happened eight months ago?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "What did painting feel like when you still did it?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "hope": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe try picking it up again. Even for ten minutes.",
          "stats": {"trust": -1, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Losing interest in things you loved is one of the hardest parts of this.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 1, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "patient_says": "I smile when people are around so they don't worry. But inside I feel completely empty.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That takes a lot of energy to maintain. How long have you been doing that?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "The people around you would probably want to know.",
          "stats": {"trust": 1, "presence": 1, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "At least you're keeping things together.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1, "loneliness": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "You don't have to perform that here. Empty is okay to say.",
          "stats": {"trust": 4, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "patient_says": "Food doesn't taste like anything. I eat because I have to, not because I want to.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That loss of pleasure in basic things is really significant. How is your appetite overall?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Are you eating enough at least?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You should try to eat foods you used to enjoy.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "When things stop having flavor it usually means more than just appetite. How long has it been like that?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "patient_says": "I don't see the point of planning anything. Why plan if nothing feels worth looking forward to?",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "When the future feels grey it's hard to want to walk toward it. What does the future look like to you right now?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Was there a time when things felt worth looking forward to?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "hope": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You have to try to stay positive.",
          "stats": {"trust": -3, "presence": -2, "loneliness": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What's the smallest thing that used to feel okay, not even good, just okay?",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "patient_says": "I cried in my car for an hour before coming in. I'm not even sure why.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "You still walked in. That took something.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 3, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Crying without knowing why can feel really disorienting. Are you okay now?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 1, "calm": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "That's fine. Emotions come out when they need to.",
          "stats": {"trust": 1, "calm": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "There doesn't always need to be a reason. Sometimes the weight just gets heavy.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "patient_says": "I've been cancelling plans so much that people have stopped inviting me. I don't blame them.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That quiet withdrawal can feel like a relief and a loss at the same time. Is it?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "What happens in your head when you think about going somewhere?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You should push yourself to go next time.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1, "loneliness": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Loneliness and the need for isolation can exist at the same time. Both of those are okay to feel.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "loneliness": -2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "patient_says": "I feel guilty all the time. Like I'm failing everyone just by existing the way I am.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Guilt like that is one of the cruelest parts of depression. Who specifically do you feel like you're failing?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You're not failing anyone by being unwell.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 1, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where does that guilt come from?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Other people probably don't see it that way.",
          "stats": {"trust": -1, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "patient_says": "I stood in the shower for twenty minutes without moving. I just stood there.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Those moments where you just stop are worth paying attention to. What were you thinking about?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing at all, or too much?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "At least you got in the shower.",
          "stats": {"trust": -1, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes the body just stops when the mind gets too heavy.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 1, "calm": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "patient_says": "I don't feel sad exactly. I just feel nothing. I think nothing is worse.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "A lot of people say exactly that. The numbness can be harder to explain than sadness.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "When did sadness turn into nothing?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing is still something. It still hurts.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 1, "hope": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "At least you're not feeling sad.",
          "stats": {"trust": -3, "presence": -2, "loneliness": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "patient_says": "My friend texted me and I just stared at it for two days. I don't know what to say.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What did they say?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes just saying I'm not doing great is enough. They reached out because they care.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "loneliness": -2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "You should reply before they think you're ignoring them.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1, "loneliness": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What do you want to say to them?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "patient_says": "I think I'm a burden to everyone around me. They'd probably be relieved if I wasn't here.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I want to make sure I understand what you mean. Can you tell me more about that thought?",
          "stats": {"trust": 4, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "That thought is something depression tells you. It's not the truth.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "hope": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm sure they don't feel that way.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1, "loneliness": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you feel safe right now?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "calm": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "patient_says": "I got dressed today for the first time in a few days. That's as good as it got.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That counts. Genuinely. What made today the day you did it?",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Getting dressed when everything feels heavy is more than people realize.",
          "stats": {"hope": 3, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good. Try to do that every day.",
          "stats": {"trust": -1, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What does the rest of today look like for you?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "motivation": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "patient_says": "I feel like I'm watching my life from behind glass. Like it's happening to someone else.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That detached feeling has a name. It's called dissociation and it's very common with depression. How long have you been feeling it?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "What would it take to feel like you're inside your life again?",
          "stats": {"presence": 2, "hope": 1, "trust": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Try to engage more with the people around you.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Being behind glass is still seeing. You haven't disappeared.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "patient_says": "I had a moment today where I laughed at something. It felt really strange.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Strange how? Like it didn't belong to you?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "That laugh was real. Hold onto it.",
          "stats": {"hope": 3, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "smile",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "See, you're getting better.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "hope": -1, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What made you laugh?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "hope": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "patient_says": "I feel like I've been this way so long I don't remember what normal felt like.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That loss of a before-self is really painful. How long has it been like this for you?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 1, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe normal isn't the goal. Maybe we find a new version that works for you.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "You'll get back to normal eventually.",
          "stats": {"trust": -1, "hope": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if you can't remember it exactly, are there glimpses of it sometimes?",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "patient_says": "I told my family I'm fine. I always tell them I'm fine.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What would happen if you told them you weren't?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "What's behind the always? Are you protecting them or yourself?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 3, "trust": 3, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You should tell them the truth.",
          "stats": {"trust": -1, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's exhausting to carry that word fine around everywhere.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "loneliness": -2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "patient_says": "I went outside for a walk today. First time in a while.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "How did it feel to be outside?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 2, "hope": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "That's genuinely significant. What made today the day?",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good. You should do that every day.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even a short walk is a step toward something. I'm glad you went.",
          "stats": {"hope": 3, "trust": 2, "motivation": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "patient_says": "I've been thinking about the past a lot. Better times. It makes now feel worse.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Grief for a version of your life can be just as heavy as any other kind of grief.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "What was it about that time that felt better?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Try not to compare. It doesn't help.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Those times existed and they were real. They don't cancel out what you're feeling now.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "patient_says": "I don't like asking for help. It feels like admitting something I'm not ready to admit.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What do you think you'd be admitting?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 3, "trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You're here. That is asking for help, even if it doesn't feel like it.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 3, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Asking for help is a strength, not a weakness.",
          "stats": {"trust": 1, "hope": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "You don't have to be ready. You just have to be here.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "calm": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "patient_says": "Some days I feel a tiny bit okay. Then I feel guilty about it, like I'm faking being sick.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Depression isn't constant. The okay days don't cancel the hard ones.",
          "stats": {"clarity": 2, "trust": 2, "hope": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "That guilt is a part of it too. You're not faking anything.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "hope": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe those okay days mean you're getting better.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "hope": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What does an okay day feel like compared to a hard one?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "patient_says": "I stopped answering my phone. Not just to certain people. To everyone.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "When did that start happening?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "presence": 1, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is there anyone you'd want to hear from if you felt safe enough?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "loneliness": -2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You really should at least let people know you're okay.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "loneliness": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "The world feeling like too much is a real thing. You're not being dramatic.",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "patient_says": "I cleaned my room today. It took everything I had but I did it.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That is not a small thing when you're running on empty. How do you feel now that it's done?",
          "stats": {"hope": 3, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm glad you did. What made you start?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "motivation": 1, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good. A clean space can really help your mood.",
          "stats": {"trust": -1, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "That took real effort. You should be proud of yourself.",
          "stats": {"hope": 3, "trust": 2, "motivation": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "patient_says": "I've been thinking about how I'd end things. Not seriously. Just thinking.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'm really glad you told me that. Even just thinking about it is something I want to understand better. Can we talk about it?",
          "stats": {"trust": 5, "loneliness": -3, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "That kind of thinking matters even when it doesn't feel serious. Are you safe right now?",
          "stats": {"trust": 4, "calm": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You shouldn't think about things like that.",
          "stats": {"trust": -4, "loneliness": 3},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thank you for trusting me with that. When does that kind of thinking come?",
          "stats": {"trust": 4, "presence": 2, "loneliness": -2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
