          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just a cup of tea?",
          "stats": {"trust": -3, "hope": -2, "presence": -2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What kind of tea?",
          "stats": {"trust": 2, "calm": 1, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "smile",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "patient_says": "I feel like a ghost in my own life. Present but not really there.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That image of a ghost is really telling. When did you start feeling like that?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "You're here right now though. That's real.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Try to engage more with things around you.",
          "stats": {"trust": -2, "presence": -1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What would it take to feel a little more solid again?",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "patient_says": "I notice small things sometimes. A nice light through the window. A song I like. Then it fades.",
      "emotion": "idle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Those moments of noticing are still you. They haven't gone away completely.",
          "stats": {"hope": 3, "trust": 2, "presence": 3},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What was the song?",
