          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hold onto those moments. They matter.",
          "stats": {"hope": 2, "trust": 1, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "That fading feeling is really hard. What does it feel like when it goes?",
          "stats": {"trust": 3, "presence": 2, "clarity": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "patient_says": "I don't think I deserve to feel better. Like I haven't earned it.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Feeling better isn't something you earn. It's something you're allowed to have.",
          "stats": {"hope": 3, "trust": 2, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where does that belief come from? That you need to earn it?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 3, "trust": 3, "presence": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        },
        {
          "text": "Of course you deserve to feel better.",
          "stats": {"trust": 1, "hope": 1},
          "patient_emotion_after": "idle",
          "player_emotion_after": "idle"
        },
        {
          "text": "What would it take for you to feel like you deserved it?",
          "stats": {"clarity": 3, "trust": 2, "presence": 2},
          "patient_emotion_after": "concern",
          "player_emotion_after": "concern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "patient_says": "I sat outside for a bit today. I didn't do anything. I just sat.",
